  "description": "IXEJAY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H72 Co2 Gd4 N10 O32,2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co1B (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.221-3.990 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.94-111.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H84Co2Gd4N10O34. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
